    description: "Scaled is not compounded. Scaled means, on the industrial scale spine, evidenced continuity multiplied across additional sites, crews, assets, or volume with the same evidence bar, ownership, and control integrity intact — the instrument-required scale the successor-spine Sustained Is Not Scaled already names, evidenced by scale package with named scale owner / site / crew / asset / volume roles, named scale criteria met (sustainment package cited, next scale window named, evidence bar the sustainment must carry intact across additional sites, crews, assets, or volume stated, ownership and control integrity still named), dates, and an unbroken trail from the sustainment evidence to that scale evidence — not a local sustain win treated as a fleet rollout, not a dashboard green multiplied by site count, not a pilot copy-paste, not a verbal \"we scaled it,\" and not a slide that copies one site's green tile into a fleet count. Compounded means, under that same named instrument for that channel, that scaled outcome generating nonlinear returns (learning, reuse, network effects, margin expansion) without reopening the evidence, ownership, and control gaps that scale closed, across the next named compounding window — evidenced by compounding package with named compounding owner / learning / reuse / network / margin roles, named compounding criteria met (scale package cited, next compounding window named, nonlinear returns the scaled outcome must generate stated as learning, reuse, network effects, or margin expansion, evidence bar and ownership and control integrity still intact and not reopened), dates, and an unbroken trail from the scale evidence to that compounding evidence — not the slide from \"we scaled the playbook\" to \"returns will compound automatically,\" not a fleet count treated as margin expansion, not a copied playbook treated as learning, not network-effect theater, and not a verbal \"we compounded it.\" Scaled is not compounded. A firm can be scaled and still not compounded (scale evidence exists while required compounding evidence for the next compounding window is missing). A firm can multiply evidenced continuity across additional sites, crews, assets, or volume with the same evidence bar, ownership, and control integrity intact and still lack nonlinear returns that do not reopen the evidence, ownership, and control gaps that scale closed. A firm can claim compounding theater and still not be scaled (a slide that says returns will compound, a copied playbook treated as learning, or a fleet count treated as margin expansion while required scale evidence is missing). Scale evidence alone is not compounding of that scaled successor outcome. A compounding claim alone is not proof the named scale evidence was on the file. A scaled playbook is not compounded returns. A CMMS checkbox, ticket state, status light, dashboard scaled tile, verbal \"we scaled it,\" fleet count treated as margin expansion, copied playbook treated as learning, or network-effect note alone is neither. A verbal \"we compounded it\" alone is neither. Keep this scaled distinct from the successor-spine Sustained Is Not Scaled. Keep this scaled distinct from the filing-spine Sustained Is Not Scaled and from Scaled Is Not Compounded. Keep this compounded distinct from the filing-spine Compounded Is Not Owned. This essay does not give that scaled a new meaning inside Sustained Is Not Scaled. This essay does not rewrite that thesis. This split is scaled versus compounded. This essay separates evidenced continuity multiplied across additional sites, crews, assets, or volume with the same evidence bar, ownership, and control integrity intact from that scaled outcome generating nonlinear returns (learning, reuse, network effects, margin expansion) without reopening the evidence, ownership, and control gaps that scale closed. Evidence from the plant beats the scale record when the record is being used as compounded. Evidence from the plant beats the compounding claim when the claim is being used as proof the named scale of that successor outcome was on the file. Sync refuses to pretend scaled or compounded is a status light. Sync does not measure compounded. Sync does not measure compounded for the customer. Sync does not measure scaled or compounded for the customer. Sync may surface a scale record or a compounding record beside Evidence, Verification, and the closed outcome. Sync must not treat scaled as compounded as Learning credit. Sync does not deem compounded for the customer. Sync must not auto-deem-compounded. A practice record that says scaled is compounded is not shown compounded. This scaled is evidenced continuity multiplied across additional sites, crews, assets, or volume with the same evidence bar, ownership, and control integrity intact on the industrial scale spine. It is not the filing-spine extension of a sustained practice in Scaled Is Not Compounded, and it is not the filing-spine deliberate extension Sustained Is Not Scaled names. This essay does not collapse into Sustained Is Not Scaled. This essay does not rewrite Sustained Is Not Scaled. This essay does not collapse into Scaled Is Not Compounded. This essay does not rewrite Scaled Is Not Compounded. This essay does not collapse into Compounded Is Not Owned. This essay does not rewrite Compounded Is Not Owned. This essay does not claim a successor route for Compounded Is Not Owned. This essay does not collapse into Transferable Is Not Binding. This essay does not rewrite Transferable Is Not Binding. This essay does not collapse into Binding Is Not Enforced. This essay does not rewrite Binding Is Not Enforced. This essay does not restate Transferable Is Not Binding or Binding Is Not Enforced as this claim. This essay does not collapse scaled into compounded. This essay does not collapse compounded into scaled. A scaled playbook is not compounded returns.",
